-- rules/policies/authority.rofl — gap acceptance requires authority.
-- An observer's opinion does not accept residual risk (roadmap §18
-- authority mutation): only the inquiry's decision authority can.
--
-- EDB:
--   decision_authority(I, Who)
--   accepted_gap_by(I, Claim, Who)

gap_accepted(I, C) :- accepted_gap_by(I, C, Who),
                      decision_authority(I, Who).
